    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "V\u00e4ljaminevad kanalid", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "S\u00fcndmused j\u00e4\u00e4vad rakendusse; kui soovid, saada sama teadet oma telefoni teavituskeskusesse v\u00f5i Telegrami. Mitte \u00fckski neist pole kohustuslik.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Sisesta teema nimi \u2014 kontot pole vaja", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "Teema", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Teavitused avaldatakse sellel teemal ntfy.sh; kui tead teema nime ainult sina, saad neid ainult sina.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "E-post", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Teated saadetakse sinu konto e-posti aadressile", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Saadetakse sinu enda aadressile sisselogituna; rakenduses ei salvestata salajasi andmeid.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Saaja", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Seadmete\u00fclene teavitamine", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Pereliikme teade j\u00f5uab teavituskeskusesse isegi siis, kui rakendus on suletud", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "L\u00e4heb teiste liikmete ja teie teiste seadmete teavituskeskustesse; saaja peab selle kanali oma seadmes lubama.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST oma serverisse \u2014 t\u00e4iustatud", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Lubatud on ainult HTTPS; iga s\u00fcndmus saadetakse kujul {source, id, title, detail, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Boti token", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "Chat ID", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "Boti token j\u00e4\u00e4b ainult sellele seadmele", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Tokenit ei laadita kunagi pilve; sisestage see uuesti teistesse seadmetesse.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
    "Sistem Bildirimleri": "S\u00fcsteemi teavitused", // EN: System Notifications
    "Taray\u0131c\u0131 ve telefonun uyar\u0131 merkezi": "Teie brauseri ja telefoni teavituskeskus", // EN: Your browser and phone notification centre
    "\u0130zin bekleniyor\u2026": "Ootame luba\u2026", // EN: Waiting for permission…
    "\u0130zin verildi": "Luba antud", // EN: Permission granted
    "\u0130zin zaten a\u00e7\u0131k": "Luba juba sees", // EN: Permission already on
    "\u0130zin reddedilmi\u015f": "Luba on keelatud", // EN: Permission denied
    "Bildirim deste\u011fi yok": "Teavituse tugi puudub", // EN: No notification support
    "De\u011fi\u015fiklikler otomatik kaydedilir.": "Muutused salvestatakse automaatselt.", // EN: Changes are saved automatically.
    "Bildirim motoru bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde y\u00fcklenmedi.": "Teavituse mootor ei laadinud seda koostamist.", // EN: The notification engine didn't load in this build.
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal": "Ava kanal", // EN: Open channel
    "Hi\u00e7bir kanal a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil.": "\u00dchtegi kanalit ei ole lubatud.", // EN: No channel is enabled.
    "G\u00f6nderilen {0}": "{0} saadetud", // EN: {0} sent
    "Hatal\u0131 {0}": "{0} eba\u00f5nnestus", // EN: {0} failed
    "Son hata": "Viimane viga", // EN: Last error
    "\u015eu an rahats\u0131z etmeyin a\u00e7\u0131k.": "\u00c4ra sega on praegu sisse l\u00fclitatud.", // EN: Do Not Disturb is on right now.
    "\u015eu an sessiz saatler i\u00e7inde.": "Vaiksed tunnid on praegu aktiivsed.", // EN: Quiet hours are active right now.
    "\u00dcstteki anahtar kapal\u0131": "\u00dclal olev l\u00fcliti on v\u00e4lja l\u00fclitatud", // EN: The switch above is off
    "hi\u00e7bir bildirim g\u00f6nderilmez.": "\u00fckski teade ei saadeta.", // EN: no notification is sent.
    "G\u00f6nderiliyor\u2026": "Saatmine\u2026", // EN: Sending…
    "\u0130letildi": "K\u00e4ttesaadud", // EN: Delivered
    "Baz\u0131 kanallar hata verdi": "M\u00f5ned kanalid eba\u00f5nnestusid", // EN: Some channels failed
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal yok": "\u00dckski kanal pole lubatud", // EN: No channel enabled
    "Sessiz saatlerde d\u0131\u015fa d\u00f6n\u00fck kanallar durur; uyar\u0131lar uygulama i\u00e7inde birikmeye devam eder.": "Vaiksete tundide ajal peatatakse v\u00e4ljuvad kanalid; teated kogunevad endiselt rakenduses.\\nLuba kriitilistel teadetel vaikseid tunde vahele j\u00e4tta", // EN: During quiet hours outbound channels pause; alerts keep accumulating inside the app.
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar sessiz saatleri a\u015fs\u0131n": "Turvateated, h\u00e4daolukorrad ja alarmid j\u00f5uavad nendel tundidel endiselt kohale.", // EN: Let critical alerts bypass quiet hours
    "G\u00fcvenlik, acil durum ve alarm olaylar\u0131 bu saatlerde de bildirilir.": "Heli ja Vibratsioon", // EN: Security, emergency and alarm events are still delivered during those hours.
    "Ses ve Titre\u015fim": "Kriitilised teated helisevad alati. Vibratsioon kehtib ainult telefonides; Androidis saab heli ja vibratsiooni muuta ka s\u00fcsteemi teavitusseadetes.", // EN: Sound and Vibration
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar her zaman sesli gelir. Titre\u015fim yaln\u0131zca telefonda ge\u00e7erlidir; Android'de ses ve titre\u015fim ayr\u0131ca telefonun bildirim ayarlar\u0131ndan da de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir.": "Alusta arvutiga", // EN: Critical alerts always sound. Vibration applies on phones only; on Android, sound and vibration can also be changed in the system notification settings.
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131nca ba\u015flat": "K\u00e4ivita NEXUS taustal, kui arvuti k\u00e4ivitub.", // EN: Start with computer
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS arka planda a\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n.": "J\u00e4tka taustal t\u00f6\u00f6tamist, kui suletud", // EN: Launch NEXUS in the background when your computer starts.
    "Kapat\u0131nca arka planda \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r": "Automatiseerimised j\u00e4tkavad s\u00fcsteemi salves t\u00f6\u00f6tamist, kui aken on suletud.", // EN: Keep running in background when closed
    "Pencere kapat\u0131lsa da otomasyonlar tepside \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam etsin.": "T\u00f5mba uuendamiseks", // EN: Automations keep running in system tray when the window is closed.
