    "Saat belirleyen bir otomasyon ekleyince bug\u00fcn\u00fcn plan\u0131 burada listelenir.": "Lisa automaatika ajaga, ja t\u00e4nane plaan kuvatakse siin.", // EN: Add an automation with a time and today's plan will be listed here.
    "Otomasyon Ekle": "Lisa automaatika", // EN: Add Automation
    "Enerji tasarruf stratejisi": "Energias\u00e4\u00e4stu strateegia", // EN: Energy saving strategy
    "Kamera kontrol paneli \u00b7 durum ve gizlilik": "Kaamera juhtpaneel \u00b7 olek & privaatsus", // EN: Camera control panel · status & privacy
    "Sesle yaz": "H\u00e4\u00e4linput", // EN: Voice input
    "Sesli giri\u015f bu taray\u0131c\u0131da desteklenmiyor (Chrome veya Edge kullan).": "H\u00e4\u00e4lsisestus ei ole selles brauseris toetatud (kasuta Chrome'i v\u00f5i Edge'i).", // EN: Voice input isn't supported in this browser (use Chrome or Edge).
    "Mikrofon izni verilmedi.": "Mikrofoni luba keelati.", // EN: Microphone permission was denied.
    "Ses tan\u0131namad\u0131, tekrar dene.": "K\u00f5ne tuvastamine eba\u00f5nnestus, proovi uuesti.", // EN: Couldn't recognize speech, try again.
    "Fabrika s\u0131f\u0131rlama": "Tehase l\u00e4htestamine", // EN: Factory reset
    "Shelly: cihaz \u00fczerindeki d\u00fc\u011fmeyi ~10 sn bas\u0131l\u0131 tut (LED h\u0131zl\u0131 yan\u0131p s\u00f6ner).": "Shelly: hoia seadme nuppu ~10 s (LED vilgub kiiresti).", // EN: Shelly: hold the button on the device for ~10 s (LED blinks fast).
    "Tasmota: ayarlar \u2192 Reset \u2192 Reset device. Veya d\u00fc\u011fmeyi 40 sn bas\u0131l\u0131 tut.": "Tasmota: Seaded \u2192 L\u00e4htesta \u2192 L\u00e4htesta seade, v\u00f5i hoia nuppu 40 s.", // EN: Tasmota: Settings → Reset → Reset device, or hold the button for 40 s.
    "WLED: ayarlar \u2192 Security & Updates \u2192 Factory reset.": "WLED: Seaded \u2192 Turvalisus ja uuendused \u2192 Tehase l\u00e4htestamine.", // EN: WLED: Settings → Security & Updates → Factory reset.
    "ESPHome: cihaz donan\u0131m\u0131na g\u00f6re d\u00fc\u011fmeyle veya config'ten 'factory_reset' eylemi.": "ESPHome: seadme nupu kaudu v\u00f5i 'factory_reset' toiminguga konfiguratsioonis.", // EN: ESPHome: via the device button or the 'factory_reset' action in its config.
    "Hue: ampul\u00fc kapat-a\u00e7 s\u0131ras\u0131yla (4 kez) fabrika moduna al\u0131r; k\u00f6pr\u00fc s\u0131f\u0131rlamalar\u0131 Hue uygulamas\u0131ndan.": "Hue: pirni vooluringi katkestamine 4 korda tehase re\u017eiimi jaoks; silla l\u00e4htestamine toimub Hue rakenduses.", // EN: Hue: power-cycle the bulb 4 times for factory mode; bridge resets are done in the Hue app.
    "Kasa: cihaz\u0131 5 sn prize tak-\u00e7\u0131kar; tekrar e\u015fle\u015ftirme gerekir.": "Kasa: seadme lahti \u00fchendamine ja uuesti \u00fchendamine 5 sekundi jooksul; seade tuleb uuesti siduda.", // EN: Kasa: unplug/replug the device for 5 s; you'll need to pair it again.
    "Yeelight: duvar d\u00fc\u011fmesini 5 kez a\u00e7-kapa (reset modu).": "Yeelight: l\u00fclita seinak\u00fclg v\u00e4lja-sisse 5 korda (l\u00e4htestamise re\u017eiim).", // EN: Yeelight: flip the wall switch off-on 5 times (reset mode).
    "WiZ: duvar d\u00fc\u011fmesini h\u0131zl\u0131ca 5 kez a\u00e7-kapa.": "WiZ: l\u00fclita seinak\u00fclg kiiresti v\u00e4lja-sisse 5 korda.", // EN: WiZ: flip the wall switch off-on quickly 5 times.
    "LIFX: d\u00fc\u011fmeyi bas\u0131l\u0131 tutun (LED beyaz d\u00f6ner) sonra b\u0131rak\u0131n.": "LIFX: hoia nuppu all (LED vilgub valgena), seej\u00e4rel vabasta.", // EN: LIFX: hold the button (LED cycles white), then release.
    "Govee LAN: cihaz\u0131n kendi d\u00fc\u011fmesiyle veya Govee uygulamas\u0131ndan.": "Govee LAN: seadme oma nupu v\u00f5i Govee rakenduse kaudu.", // EN: Govee LAN: with the device's own button or from the Govee app.
    "Sonoff DIY: d\u00fc\u011fmeyi 5+ sn bas\u0131l\u0131 tut.": "Sonoff DIY: hoia nuppu alla 5+ sekundit.", // EN: Sonoff DIY: hold the button for 5+ seconds.
    "Tapo: uygulamas\u0131ndan ayarlar \u2192 cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r/s\u0131f\u0131rla; kamera ise SETUP d\u00fc\u011fmesi 5 sn.": "Tapo: rakenduse kaudu, Seaded \u2192 eemalda/l\u00e4htesta seade; kaamerad kasutavad seadistuse nuppu 5 sekundi jooksul.", // EN: Tapo: from its app, Settings → remove/reset the device; cameras use the SETUP button for 5 s.
    "Cihaz\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlamak i\u00e7in \u00fcreticinin uygulamas\u0131ndaki Fabrika S\u0131f\u0131rlama ad\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 kullan.": "Seadme l\u00e4htestamiseks kasuta tehase l\u00e4htestamise sammu tootja rakenduses.", // EN: To reset the device, use the Factory Reset step in the manufacturer's app.
    "En az 8 karakter; harf + rakam kullan.": "V\u00e4hemalt 8 m\u00e4rki; kasuta t\u00e4hti + numbreid.", // EN: At least 8 characters; use letters + digits.
    "\u00c7ok zay\u0131f \u2014 en az 8 karakter kullan.": "V\u00e4ga n\u00f5rk \u2014 kasuta v\u00e4hemalt 8 m\u00e4rki. N\u00f5rk \u2014 lisa t\u00e4hti + numbreid. Keskmine \u2014 lisa suur t\u00e4ht v\u00f5i s\u00fcmbol. Hea. Tugev parool. Tulekul (TOTP rakenduse koodid) Kontrollimine Olemas pilvekontoga Logi esmalt sisse oma pilvekontoga. Ei saanud staatust laadida Autentimisrakenduse kood on sees Kaheastmeline kinnitamine vajab pilvekontot. Sisesta autentimiskood, et see v\u00e4lja l\u00fclitada. Skaneeri kood oma autentimisrakendusega, seej\u00e4rel sisesta 6 numbrit. Seadistuskood Kui sa ei saa skaneerida, sisesta see v\u00f5ti rakendusse: Kood peab olema 6 numbrit. Kood on vale v\u00f5i on aegunud. Kood on vale v\u00f5i on aegunud. Koodid ei \u00fchti, kui sinu telefoni kell ei ole automaatselt seadistatud; l\u00fclita see automaatseks ja proovi uuendatud koodi. Koodi ei saanud kinnitada. Tegevust ei saanud l\u00f5pule viia.", // EN: Very weak — use at least 8 characters.
