    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Kaheastmeline autentimine on sisse l\u00fclitatud.", // EN: Two-step verification is on.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama kapat\u0131ld\u0131.": "Kaheastmeline autentimine on v\u00e4lja l\u00fclitatud.", // EN: Two-step verification is off.
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki 6 haneli kodu gir.": "Sisestage 6-kohaline kood oma autentimisrakendusest.", // EN: Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app.
    "Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator gibi bir kimlik uygulamas\u0131 a\u00e7.": "Avage autentimisrakendus, n\u00e4iteks Google Authenticator v\u00f5i Microsoft Authenticator.", // EN: Open an authenticator app such as Google Authenticator or Microsoft Authenticator.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki kodu okut ya da anahtar\u0131 elle gir.": "Skannige allolev kood v\u00f5i sisestage v\u00f5ti k\u00e4sitsi.", // EN: Scan the code below or enter the key by hand.
    "Uygulamadaki 6 haneli kodu yaz ve Do\u011frula'ya dokun.": "Tippige rakendusest 6-kohaline kood ja puudutage kinnitamist.", // EN: Type the 6-digit code from the app and tap Verify.
    "Uygulamada eski bir NEXUS kayd\u0131 varsa sil; her kurulumda yeni anahtar \u00fcretilir, yaln\u0131z en son okuttu\u011funun kodu ge\u00e7erlidir.": "Kustutage rakendusest k\u00f5ik vanad NEXUS kirjed; iga seadistamine loob uue v\u00f5tme ja kehtib ainult viimasena skannitud koodi.", // EN: Delete any old NEXUS entry in the app; each setup creates a new key, and only the code of the one you scanned last is valid.
    "Geli\u015fmi\u015f ba\u011flant\u0131lar: Home Assistant cihaz\u0131 ekle": "T\u00e4psemad \u00fchendused: lisage Home Assistant seadmeid", // EN: Advanced connections: add Home Assistant devices
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, cihaz kimli\u011finin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Seadmega ei \u00f5nnestunud \u00fchendust luua. Veenduge, et see on samas v\u00f5rgus ja seadme ID ning kohaliku v\u00f5tme andmed on \u00f5iged.", // EN: Could not connect to the device. Make sure it is on the same network and that the device ID and local key are correct.
    "Broker'a ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parolan\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ei \u00f5nnestunud luua \u00fchendust vahendajaga. Veenduge, et kasutajanimi ja parool on \u00f5iged.", // EN: Could not connect to the broker. Make sure the username and password are correct.
