    "Do\u011frula": "Kinnita", // EN: Verify
    "Yak\u0131nda": "Varsti", // EN: Coming soon
    "Hesab\u0131m": "Minu konto", // EN: My Account
    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Kustuta minu konto", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Teie konto, profiil ja s\u00fcnkroonitud andmed on j\u00e4\u00e4davalt kustutatud. Kui teil on aktiivne NEXUS+ tellimus, t\u00fchistage see k\u00f5igepealt arveldamisest. Seda ei saa tagasi v\u00f5tta.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Kas olete kindel? Puudutage uuesti, et kustutada", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Kustutatakse\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Konto kustutatud. Pidage meeles, et t\u00fchistage oma tellimus oma Whop kontolt.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Teie konto ja andmed kustutati.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Selle seadme NEXUS andmete eemaldamiseks piisab Seaded \u2192 Logi v\u00e4lja; pilvekonto pole olemas.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Serveripoolne konto kustutamine pole veel kasutuses. Praegu saate lihtsalt v\u00e4lja logida.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! L\u00fclitasin \u201e\u00c4ra sega\u201d re\u017eiimi sisse; \u00fckski teade ei hakka teid t\u00fc\u00fctama. [TEGEVUS: L\u00dcLITA_DND_SISSE]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\"stseenaariumi\" saab praegu koduekraani Tap to Run kaardilt \u00fche puudutusega k\u00e4ivitada. Kui NEXUS on App Store'is, saate selle otse sellest ekraanist Siri juurde lisada.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "ja k\u00f5ik selle s\u00e4tted kustutatakse j\u00e4\u00e4davalt. Olete kindel?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
