    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "See 8-kohaline kood on m\u00f5eldud Apple HomeKit'iga sidumiseks ja t\u00f6\u00f6tab ainult Apple Home rakenduse puhul. Kui seade toetab kohalikku API-d, nagu Shelly, WLED v\u00f5i Tasmota, saate selle lisada oma kohalikust v\u00f5rgust.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "See seade", // EN: This Device
