    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Sellel aadressil ei leitud \u00fchtegi tuntud NEXUS-seadet. Veenduge, et seade on sisse l\u00fclitatud ja \u00fchendatud samasse v\u00f5rku.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
