    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Kontrollige seadme WiFi-\u00fchendust ja oma ruuterit. Kui probleem p\u00fcsib, eemaldage seade ja lisage see uuesti. Sammud: Seadmed > vali seade > Eemalda.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Kontrollige seadme WiFi-\u00fchendust ja oma ruuterit. Kui probleem p\u00fcsib, eemaldage seade NEXUS rakendusest ja lisage see uuesti.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Kui teie seade ei ilmu, kasutage QR-skannimist v\u00f5i seadistuskoodi. Saate avada abilehe abi ja juhiste saamiseks.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
