    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "L\u00fclita kodus sisse j\u00e4etud k\u00f5ik valgustusr\u00fchmad v\u00e4lja.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "Kodus ja eemal", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "Eemal", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Kui eemal", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Haldage oma kodu valgust igas toas j\u00e4rjestuses. \u00dcks rakendus k\u00f5igi sisse-/v\u00e4ljal\u00fclitamise, heleduse, v\u00e4rvitemperatuuri ja kiirete stseenide otseteede jaoks.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Anna valmis k\u00e4ske, kiireid automatiseeringuid ja nutikaid rakenduse soovitusi kodus olevate seadmete p\u00f5hjal.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Loo kliimaseadmete mugavuse rakendus, mis haldab kodus olevaid kliimaseadmeid ja termostaate \u00fchest paneelist. Lisa temperatuuri reguleerimine, kiirmoodid, \u00f6komood ja toap\u00f5hised tegevused.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Mis on minu seadmete olek?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "Kodust eemal", // EN: Away from Home
    "Evden Uzakta Senaryosu": "Kodust eemal stseen", // EN: Away from Home Scene
    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Viib kokku energiakontrolli ja turvameetmed, kui lahkud kodust.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
    "Evden uzakta": "Kodust eemal", // EN: Away from home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Kodust lahkumine", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Kodust lahkumise kontroll", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Kodust lahkumise stseen", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "Kodust lahkumise kokkuv\u00f5te", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "L\u00f5peta kodust lahkumine", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Loo kodust lahkumise kontrolli rakendus, mis n\u00e4itab \u00fchel ekraanil, millised seadmed on sisse l\u00fclitatud, luku staatus ja energiaseaded. Lisa kiirv\u00e4ljal\u00fclitus- ja turvalisuse aktiveerimise nupud.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Kontrolli \u00fches vooges, millised seadmed on sisse l\u00fclitatud, lukud ja energiaseis kodust lahkudes.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "N\u00e4ita \u00fchel ekraanil kodust lahkudes \u00fclej\u00e4\u00e4nud seadmeid, lukkude ja energia seisundit. Vaata \u00fchel paneelil kodust lahkudes \u00fclej\u00e4\u00e4nud tuled, pistikupesad, konditsioneerid ja turvas\u00e4tted. Koonda kiire v\u00e4lja l\u00fclitamise ja turvalisuse aktiveerimise sammud \u00fchte voogu. Teeme l\u00f5plikud kontrollid enne, kui lahkud. L\u00fclita tuled automaatselt v\u00e4lja p\u00e4rast lahkumist kodust. L\u00fclita tuled automaatselt v\u00e4lja p\u00e4rast kodust lahkumist ja sisse, kui naased. L\u00fclita konditsioneer automaatselt v\u00e4lja, kui keegi ei ole kodus, ja v\u00e4ldi tarbetut energiatarbimist. L\u00fclita \u00f6\u00f6sel valitud ajal automaatselt v\u00e4lja ootel seadmed. Kodust lahkudes. L\u00fclita pistikupesa kodust lahkudes v\u00e4lja. Kodust lahkudes. Olen kodus. Tere tulemast koju. Kui sa j\u00f5uad koju v\u00f5i lahkud.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
