    "Bu hafta kayda de\u011fer bir etkinlik yok. Senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 ve uyar\u0131lar burada toplan\u0131r.": "Sel n\u00e4dalal pole m\u00e4rkimisv\u00e4\u00e4rset tegevust. Stseenide k\u00e4ivitused ja hoiatused kogunevad siia.\\nOstukiri, kodused t\u00f6\u00f6d v\u00f5i kiire m\u00e4rkus \u2014 lisa esimene \u00fcksus, et seda oma perega jagada.", // EN: No notable activity this week. Scene runs and alerts gather here.
    "Al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f listesi, ev i\u015fleri ya da k\u0131sa notlar \u2014 ailenle payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n ilk maddeyi ekle.": "Tahvel kuulub sinu kodu liikmetele. Loo kodu Kodu haldamisest v\u00f5i liitu kutse kaudu.", // EN: Shopping list, chores or quick notes — add the first item to share with your family.
    "Ev Panosu evin \u00fcyeleri aras\u0131ndad\u0131r. Ev Y\u00f6netimi'nden ev olu\u015ftur ya da davetle kat\u0131l.": "See \u00fcksus on k\u00f5ikidele liikmetele tahvlilt eemaldatud.", // EN: The board belongs to your home's members. Create a home from Home Management or join by invite.
    "Bu madde panodan t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.": "Tahvel pole hetkel saadaval.", // EN: This item is removed from the board for all members.
    "Pano \u015fu an kapal\u0131.": "Logi sisse, et kasutada Kodu tahvlit.", // EN: The board is unavailable right now.
