    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Ba\u015flat": "Alusta silda", // EN: Start the bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Vajuta silla \u00fcmarat nuppu, seej\u00e4rel proovi uuesti.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Vajuta silla \u00fclemisel osal olevat \u00fcmarat nuppu, seej\u00e4rel puuduta 30 sekundi jooksul \u201e\u00dchenda sild\u201d.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Sildu ei \u00f5nnestunud \u00fchendada. Veendu, et oled samas v\u00f5rgus, ja proovi uuesti.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011fl\u0131 lamba bulunamad\u0131.": "Sildu \u00fchendatud lampe ei leitud.", // EN: No lamps connected to the bridge were found.
