    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Sellel aadressil on seade, kuid see ei kasuta NEXUS protokolli.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
