    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "\u00dchenda ja lisa", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "\u00dchendamiskood ei ole kehtiv. Sisestage 11-kohaline kood v\u00f5i QR-sisu, mis algab MT:-ga.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Sisestage see kood NEXUS t\u00f6\u00f6laua rakendusse. Kui seade on Wi-Fis, saate selle lisada ka oma kohalikust v\u00f5rgust IP-aadressi kaudu.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Seadet otsitakse samas v\u00f5rgus ja seda \u00fchendatakse. See v\u00f5ib v\u00f5tta kuni minuti; seade peab olema sisse l\u00fclitatud ja \u00fchendamisre\u017eiimis.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Seadet ei leitud v\u00f5i sellega ei olnud v\u00f5imalik siduda. Veendu, et see oleks samas v\u00f5rgus, sisse l\u00fclitatud ja sidumisre\u017eiimis.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Seadet ei leitud. Veendu, et see oleks samas v\u00f5rgus, sisse l\u00fclitatud ja sidumisre\u017eiimis. Sinu arvuti tulem\u00fc\u00fcr v\u00f5ib blokeerida vastuseid seadmetelt kohalikus v\u00f5rgus.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Seadet ei \u00f5nnestunud siduda. Kontrolli sidumiskoodi ja seda, et seade oleks sidumisre\u017eiimis.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Seade on \u00fchendatud, kuid NEXUS ei saa seda juhtida.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Seade ei vastanud. Veendu, et see on sisse l\u00fclitatud ja samas v\u00f5rgus.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
