    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Muidugi! Maan saan sulle kokku panna suurep\u00e4rase nutika stsenaariumi. Kas saaksid anda m\u00f5ned detailid? N\u00e4iteks: \u201eAlusta kohvimasinat, kui ma \u00e4rkan\u201c v\u00f5i \u201eTume laksu t\u00e4pselt, kui ma vaataksin filmi\u201c.", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
