    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Koguge k\u00f5ik kodu kontrollid, mida vajate enne magamaminekut, \u00fchte keskkonna. H\u00e4marad tuled, \u00e4rge h\u00e4irige, lukukontroll ja \u00f6ised kliimaseaded \u00fchel ekraanil.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Loo magamamineku ettevalmistuskeskus, mis haldab valgustust, vaikse re\u017eiimi, lukke ja temperatuuri enne magamaminekut. Lisa l\u00f5plik kontrolli kokkuv\u00f5te ja \u00fche puudutusega \u00f6\u00f6re\u017eiim.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
