    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Ava see ekraan NEXUS rakenduses oma iPhone\u2019is; sinu stseenid on allpool loetletud ja saad iga\u00fche jaoks seadistada Siri kiirklahvi.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
