    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 NEXUS'u a\u00e7ar ve senaryoyu hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "See link avab NEXUS-i ja k\u00e4ivitab stseeni kohe.", // EN: This link opens NEXUS and runs the scene right away.
