    "Kap\u0131 veya Pencere A\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kui uks v\u00f5i aken avaneb", // EN: When a Door or Window Opens
    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kui uks/akna andur avaneb", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
