    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Seadme ja anduri vallandajad ilmuvad siia, kui lisad sobiva seadme.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
    "Ev ve \u00c7evre": "Kodu ja \u00fcmbrus", // EN: Home & Surroundings
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, r\u00fczg\u00e2r ya da ya\u011f\u0131\u015f bir e\u015fi\u011fi ge\u00e7ti\u011finde": "Kui temperatuur, tuul v\u00f5i vihm \u00fcletab piiri", // EN: When temperature, wind or rain passes a threshold
