    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "L\u00fclitab v\u00e4lja k\u00f5ik tuled.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "L\u00fclitab tuled sisse t\u00e4isv\u00f5imsusel p\u00e4evavalguse toonis.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Seadistab tuled 85% neutraalse tooni peale ja l\u00fclitab teleri v\u00e4lja.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Seadistab tuled 40% soojas toonis.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Iga \u00f5htu 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "L\u00fclitab kliimaseadme sisse 20\u00b0 juures ja seab termostaadi 20\u00b0 peale.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
