    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Iga p\u00e4ev p\u00e4ikeseloojangu ajal", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Lukustab k\u00f5ik nutilukud (lukud ei avane kunagi).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "L\u00fclitab tuled ja TV v\u00e4lja; j\u00e4tab pistikupesad ja kliimaseadme rahule.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
