    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "L\u00fclita sisse", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "L\u00fclita v\u00e4lja", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Vali seade, mida kontrollida.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Vaata oma andurite m\u00f5\u00f5detud \u00f5hukvaliteeti, temperatuuri ja niiskust ning kontrolli oma \u00f5hupuhastit.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Valmista tuled, kardinad ja kliimaseade p\u00e4evaks \u00fche puudutusega.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "L\u00fclita tuled, kardinad ja kliima korraga sisse, kui koju j\u00f5uad.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Pane oma seadmed turvalisse, energias\u00e4\u00e4stlikku olekusse, kui oled pikemalt \u00e4ra.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "H\u00e4maraks tuled, sulge kardinad ja l\u00fclita teler sisse.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Alusta oma robottolmuimejat v\u00f5i saada see tagasi oma laadimisjaama.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Lukusta uks, sulge kardinad ja valmista maja \u00f6\u00f6ks.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Vaata oma kaamerate olekut ja privaatsusseadeid \u00fchel ekraanil.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "L\u00fclita kaamerate privaatsusre\u017eiim sisse v\u00f5i v\u00e4lja \u00fchest kohast, olles kodus.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Vaata, millised automatiseerimised t\u00e4na toimuvad.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Jaga m\u00e4rkmeid ja meeldetuletusi oma koduga.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Vaata oma kodu tervisesummat \u00f5hu, niiskuse ja temperatuuri p\u00f5hjal, mida sinu andurid m\u00f5\u00f5davad.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131n yerel a\u011fdan ula\u015f\u0131labilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Kontrolli, kas sinu seadmeid saab lokaalv\u00f5rgu kaudu saavutada.", // EN: Check whether your devices can be reached over your local network.
